  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.13 \"Food handling area\" means those areas where food is prepared, stored or handled for human and animal consumption.\n\nSource. #1301, eff 1-10-79; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (from Pes 101.12)",
